# Synthetic pollution fixture for Tailwind v4 oxide scan-hang repro (#21009).
# Generated by scripts/repro/tailwind-scan-hang/setup.sh — never committed.
#
# NOTE: in builder testing on oxide v4.1.18, this gitignore entry caused oxide
# to skip the fixture entirely (verified by injecting unique utility classes
# that did not appear in output CSS). This contradicts #21009's claim that
# oxide ignores .gitignore. Operators reproducing the hang must comment this
# entry out so oxide scans the fixture.
tmp-tailwind-repro/

# Agent worktree dirs (mirror of .loom/worktrees/). Not gitignored historically
# but accumulates in long-lived dev checkouts and contributes to #21009 scanner
# pollution. Worktrees here are local-only working copies.
.claude/worktrees/
